msgid ""
"The zram device could not be created. This kernel probably does not support "
"zram."
msgstr ""
"Neizdevās izveidot zram ierīci. Šis kodols, visticamāk, neatbalsta zram."

msgid "Please wait..."
msgstr "Lūdzu, uzgaidiet..."

