msgstr "Restartēt tagad"

msgid "Later"
msgstr "Vēlāk"

msgid "No suitable storage"
msgstr "Nav piemērotas krātuves"

msgid ""
"No storage device with a Linux file system (ext2/3/4, xfs, ...) was found.\n"
"Swap files cannot be created on FAT, exFAT, NTFS or network drives."
msgstr ""
"Netika atrasta krātuve ar Linux failu sistēmu (ext2/3/4, xfs, ...).\n"
"Mijmaiņas failus nevar izveidot FAT, exFAT, NTFS vai tīkla diskos."

msgid "No drive needed  ·  fastest  ·  uses a little CPU"
msgstr "Disks nav vajadzīgs  ·  ātrākais  ·  nedaudz noslogo CPU"

